  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the circuit, the logical value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;when potential at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and the logical value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;when potential at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4f4d7f8f-4d4b-42d5-aa24-a033363b22c1-image.png\" style=\"width: 221px; height: 170px;\" /></p><p>The truth table of the given circuit will be :</p>",
